<title>UK: Fannie Mae sets $500 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $500 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    20.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+98 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED WEDNESDAY</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.JUL.06</p>
<p> NOTES   ***CALLABLE AT PAR AFTER THREE YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
